    "status": "ready",
    "html": "<figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/banner_en.png\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-2.1 banner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Qwen-Image-2.1 banner\"></figure><p><a href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GITHUB</a>\n<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HUGGING FACE</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MODELSCOPE</a></p><p>We are excited to open-source <strong>Qwen-Image-2.1</strong>, an image model in the Qwen family that balances generation quality, inference efficiency, and cost. Qwen-Image-2.1 unifies text-to-image generation and image editing in a single model, with just <strong>7B parameters in its visual generation component</strong> and native support for generating and editing transparent images.</p><p>This update introduces four key improvements:</p><ul><li><strong>Compact and efficient</strong>: A lightweight architecture and inference optimizations balance image quality and computational cost.</li><li><strong>Native transparency, unified creation and editing</strong>: Generate regular or transparent images from prompts, edit transparent layers, and extract subjects from photos.</li><li><strong>Versatile editing</strong>: Use up to <strong>10 reference images</strong>, specify local edits, preserve people and products, and handle a wide range of tasks.</li><li><strong>Realistic textures and refined aesthetics</strong>: Improved typography, portrait lighting, and fine details make generated images more visually compelling.</li></ul><h2 id=\"section-compact-and-efficient\">Compact and Efficient<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-compact-and-efficient\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-compact-and-efficient\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Compact and Efficient#\">#</a></h2><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 uses a lightweight architecture. Its visual generation component contains <strong>32 Single-Stream DiT layers and 7B parameters</strong>. Despite its compact size, the model delivers strong image generation quality. The Qwen-Image-Bench comparison below shows its performance alongside other open-source and closed-source models.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-01.png\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-Bench evaluation comparison\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Qwen-Image-Bench evaluation comparison\"><figcaption><p>Qwen-Image-Bench evaluation comparison</p></figcaption></figure><p>Inference efficiency is another focus, particularly when editing with multiple input images. This optimization comes from a <strong>mixed-granularity attention architecture</strong>. Text, including the system prefix and editing instructions, uses a token-level causal mask, while image generation uses a chunk-level mask. <strong>KV cache reuse</strong> allows input images and editing instructions to serve as static context, computed and cached in the first step to improve inference efficiency and reduce memory usage.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-03.png\" alt=\"Qwen-Image-2.1 mixed-granularity attention architecture\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Qwen-Image-2.1 mixed-granularity attention architecture\"><figcaption><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 mixed-granularity attention architecture</p></figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"section-native-transparency-unified-creation-and-editing\">Native Transparency, Unified Creation and Editing<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-native-transparency-unified-creation-and-editing\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-native-transparency-unified-creation-and-editing\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Native Transparency, Unified Creation and Editing#\">#</a></h2><p>Native transparency is a major addition in this release. In December 2025, we introduced Qwen-Image-Layered as a dedicated model supporting transparent image generation. Qwen-Image-2.1 now integrates this capability into a unified model, using the prompt to determine whether to output a regular image or an image with a transparency channel.</p><p>Here are examples of transparent images generated directly from text:</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-04.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent images generated from text (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-05.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent images generated from text (2)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-06.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent images generated from text (3)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent images generated from text (3)\"></div><p>Beyond individual subjects, the model can generate more complex transparent images composed of multiple elements, opening up further possibilities for design and asset creation.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-07.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent compositions with multiple elements (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent compositions with multiple elements (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-08.png?v=cac12076c2cd\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent compositions with multiple elements (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent compositions with multiple elements (2)\"></div><p>By unifying generation and editing, Qwen-Image-2.1 also supports editing transparent images directly. For example, it can change a subject’s expression while retaining the transparent background. The input is on the left and the edited result on the right.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-09.png?v=ee4de1b5241d\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-10.png?v=611bf03abb39\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Expression editing on a transparent image: input and result (2)\"></div><p>Text within a transparent layer can also be edited. In the following example, “BLOOM” is replaced with “Qwen-Image”.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-11.png?v=1f2803db504a\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-12.png?v=9d0fa2b0e13a\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Transparent text editing: replacing BLOOM with Qwen-Image (2)\"></div><p>This capability extends to real photographs. Given an RGB image, the model can extract the desired subject as an RGBA layer with transparency, making it easier to reuse elements in subsequent design and composition work.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-13.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-14.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Extracting a transparent RGBA layer from an RGB photograph (2)\"></div><h2 id=\"section-versatile-editing\">Versatile Editing<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-versatile-editing\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-versatile-editing\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Versatile Editing#\">#</a></h2><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 improves editing in four areas: multiple reference images, local editing, fidelity preservation, and task coverage.</p><h3 id=\"section-multiple-references-up-to-10-input-images\">Multiple References: Up to 10 Input Images<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-multiple-references-up-to-10-input-images\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-multiple-references-up-to-10-input-images\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Multiple References: Up to 10 Input Images#\">#</a></h3><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 supports <strong>up to 10 reference images</strong>, combining multiple subjects and assets into a coherent composition. In the group portrait example below, six individual portraits on the left are brought together in one photograph.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-15.png\" alt=\"A group photograph generated from six portrait references\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：A group photograph generated from six portrait references\"><figcaption><p>A group photograph generated from six portrait references</p></figcaption></figure><p>For virtual try-on, five inputs—a model, clothing, shoes, a bag, and a hat—can be combined into a complete outfit.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-16.png\" alt=\"A complete outfit generated from five reference images\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：A complete outfit generated from five reference images\"><figcaption><p>A complete outfit generated from five reference images</p></figcaption></figure><p>For interior design, the model can use 10 images of furnishings to generate a complete room arrangement.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-17.png\" alt=\"An interior generated from ten furnishing references\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：An interior generated from ten furnishing references\"><figcaption><p>An interior generated from ten furnishing references</p></figcaption></figure><h3 id=\"section-local-editing-flexible-region-selection\">Local Editing: Flexible Region Selection<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-local-editing-flexible-region-selection\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-local-editing-flexible-region-selection\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Local Editing: Flexible Region Selection#\">#</a></h3><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 supports circles, painted annotations, and separate masks to specify where an edit should take place.</p><p>The first example uses circles of different colors to identify three regions at once: “Remove the metal watch in the blue circle, change the hair in the red circle to black, and replace the area in the green circle with gray short-sleeved linen pajamas.” The annotated input is on the left, and the result is on the right.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-18.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-19.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Circle-guided editing of a watch, hair, and clothing (2)\"></div><p>Painted annotations provide another way to identify a region. In this example, the model adds a diver to the area marked in white on the right side of the input image.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-20.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-21.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Paint-guided editing: adding a diver to the marked region (2)\"></div><p>Circles and painted annotations obscure some of the original content. To preserve the complete input, Qwen-Image-2.1 also accepts <strong>the original image and a separate mask as two inputs</strong>. The following example asks the model to generate a cowboy on horseback, using these two images:</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-22.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-23.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Local editing inputs: original image and separate mask (2)\"></div><p>The model edits the region specified by the mask, producing the following result:</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-24.png\" alt=\"Mask-guided editing result: a cowboy on horseback\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Mask-guided editing result: a cowboy on horseback\"><figcaption><p>Mask-guided editing result: a cowboy on horseback</p></figcaption></figure><p>Local editing can also support sequential creation. By making successive changes while preserving the rest of the scene, edited images can be assembled into simple animations, as illustrated by the capybara Calabash Brothers example below.</p><p><a href=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/videos/hulu_final_48f_6fps.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在原站查看媒体</a></p><h3 id=\"section-fidelity-preserving-people-and-products\">Fidelity: Preserving People and Products<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-fidelity-preserving-people-and-products\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-fidelity-preserving-people-and-products\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Fidelity: Preserving People and Products#\">#</a></h3><p>Fidelity improvements focus on <strong>portrait identity</strong> and <strong>product consistency</strong>. For portraits, the model better preserves facial features so that a person’s identity remains more consistent across edits. Each pair below shows the input on the left and the edited result on the right.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-25.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-26.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example one: input and result (2)\"></div><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-27.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-28.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example two: input and result (2)\"></div><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-29.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-30.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait fidelity example three: input and result (2)\"></div><p>For product editing, the model aims to preserve text, textures, and shape, keeping the product’s defining features consistent in a new image.</p><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-31.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example one: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example one: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-32.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example one: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example one: input and result (2)\"></div><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-33.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example two: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example two: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-34.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example two: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example two: input and result (2)\"></div><div><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-35.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example three: input and result (1)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example three: input and result (1)\">\n<img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-36.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Product fidelity example three: input and result (2)\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Product fidelity example three: input and result (2)\"></div><h3 id=\"section-task-coverage-panoramas-infographics-and-storyboards\">Task Coverage: Panoramas, Infographics, and Storyboards<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-task-coverage-panoramas-infographics-and-storyboards\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-task-coverage-panoramas-infographics-and-storyboards\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Task Coverage: Panoramas, Infographics, and Storyboards#\">#</a></h3><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 supports a broad range of editing tasks, including panorama, infographic, and storyboard generation, balancing capabilities across different applications.</p><p>For example, starting from this selfie:</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-37.png\" alt=\"Input selfie for panorama generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Input selfie for panorama generation\"><figcaption><p>Input selfie for panorama generation</p></figcaption></figure><p>The model generates the following panorama:</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-38.png\" alt=\"Panorama generated from the selfie\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Panorama generated from the selfie\"><figcaption><p>Panorama generated from the selfie</p></figcaption></figure><p>The panorama can then be explored from different viewing directions in a visualization tool.</p><p><a href=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/videos/pano_video2_10s_noaudio.mp4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在原站查看媒体</a></p><p>For infographic generation, a model photograph can be expanded into a detailed, information-rich composition.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-39.png\" alt=\"Input model photograph for infographic generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Input model photograph for infographic generation\"><figcaption><p>Input model photograph for infographic generation</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-40.png\" alt=\"Complex infographic generated from the model photograph\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Complex infographic generated from the model photograph\"><figcaption><p>Complex infographic generated from the model photograph</p></figcaption></figure><p>The model can also turn a three-view character reference into a complete storyboard, providing material for storytelling and visual narratives.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-41.png\" alt=\"Three-view character reference for storyboard generation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Three-view character reference for storyboard generation\"><figcaption><p>Three-view character reference for storyboard generation</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-42.png\" alt=\"Complete storyboard generated from the character reference\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Complete storyboard generated from the character reference\"><figcaption><p>Complete storyboard generated from the character reference</p></figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"section-realistic-textures-and-refined-aesthetics\">Realistic Textures and Refined Aesthetics<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-realistic-textures-and-refined-aesthetics\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-realistic-textures-and-refined-aesthetics\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Realistic Textures and Refined Aesthetics#\">#</a></h2><p>Qwen-Image-2.1 further improves visual quality, with particular attention to typography and portraits. Text rendering considers not only the content itself, but also type styles, layout, and their relationship to the overall composition. The following examples showcase text rendering across different settings.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-43.png\" alt=\"Text rendering example one\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Text rendering example one\"><figcaption><p>Text rendering example one</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-44.png\" alt=\"Text rendering example two\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Text rendering example two\"><figcaption><p>Text rendering example two</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-45.png\" alt=\"Text rendering example three\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Text rendering example three\"><figcaption><p>Text rendering example three</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-46.png\" alt=\"Text rendering example four\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Text rendering example four\"><figcaption><p>Text rendering example four</p></figcaption></figure><p>For portraits, improved lighting and fine details give generated images a more realistic appearance.</p><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-47.png\" alt=\"Portrait lighting and detail example one\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait lighting and detail example one\"><figcaption><p>Portrait lighting and detail example one</p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen-Image/image2.1/images/example-48.png\" alt=\"Portrait lighting and detail example two\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：Portrait lighting and detail example two\"><figcaption><p>Portrait lighting and detail example two</p></figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"section-conclusion\">Conclusion<a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"#section-conclusion\">#</a><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-conclusion\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：Conclusion#\">#</a></h2><p>With a compact 7B visual generation component, Qwen-Image-2.1 brings image generation, transparency, and a wide range of editing capabilities together in one model. Faster inference, support for up to 10 reference images, flexible local editing, and improved fidelity for people and products make it a practical tool for design, content creation, e-commerce, and visual storytelling.</p><p>We hope you enjoy creating with Qwen-Image-2.1!</p>",
